[
  {
    "id": 0,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "入ったわね、暗黒の氷海！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "We're in it now—the Midnight Sea!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヴァレリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 1,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "こいつは猛烈なお出迎えだね！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "And what a welcome it's rolling out for us!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "シトリン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Citrine"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 2,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "雪が痛いし、呼吸ができない……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "The snow stings and I can barely breathe..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "キューン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Quinn"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 3,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "なんじゃ、この程度で弱音か？\n九偉人ともあろう者が",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Complaining already? You're one of the Nine—act like it!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ゼロ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Zero"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 4,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "まったくだ、吹雪などもののうちに入らんだろうに",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Quite. A little blizzard hardly counts as an obstacle."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヘルト",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Held"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 5,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "なんでこの状況で平然としていられるのよ……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "How are you two so calm right now...?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヴァレリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 6,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "寒冷地仕様の呼吸法がある。\nそこから気を付けろ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "There's a breathing technique suited for cold climates. Mind your form from here on."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヘルト",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Held"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 7,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "呼吸法？\u3000具体的には？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Breathing technique? Care to elaborate?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "シトリン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Citrine"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 8,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "自分で考えろ。赤子じゃあるまい",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Figure it out yourself. You're not a baby."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ゼロ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Zero"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 9,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "うぅ、やっぱり厳しい……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ugh, this is really rough..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "キューン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Quinn"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 10,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "やれやれ、いいかい？\u3000身をかがめて\n鼻や口に雪が当たらないように……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alright, alright. Crouch down low and angle your face so the snow doesn't hit your nose and mouth..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イェルカ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Jelka"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 11,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "警告、魔物が接近しています",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alert. Monsters approaching."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヤドヴィガ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Jadwiga"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 12,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ええっ！？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "What?!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヴァレリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 13,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "こんな時に！\u3000倒さなくては……！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Now of all times! We have to take them down...!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ゴゥ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Gou"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 14,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ですが、こうも風が強いと戦うといっても……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "But fighting in winds this strong may prove difficult..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "リーベ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Liebe"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 15,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "しょうがない、ここは英雄が守るとするか",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "No matter. I suppose this is where the heroes step up."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヘルト",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Held"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 16,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "なるほど、この環境下で生き抜いているだけはある。\nなかなかの歯応え、こうでなくてはのう！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ha! Surviving out here has made them worth fighting. Now this is what I call a real challenge!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ゼロ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Zero"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 17,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "さすが、敵にすると恐ろしい分\n味方のときは頼もしいわ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "As terrifying as they are to face, they're just as reassuring to have on our side."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヴァレリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 18,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "アタシたちも続くよ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "We're right behind you!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イェルカ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Jelka"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 19,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "が、頑張る！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I-I'll do my best!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "キューン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Quinn"
        }
      }
    }
  }
]